{"name": "Expedition Bonk", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expedition Bonk is a turn-based RPG about taking an underqualified party and making them stronger, one questionable decision at a time. Fight enemies, unlock skills and build a party that might actually survive the job your teacher volunteered you for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">=== Plan the turn, then pull it off ===</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/234290f8a9f7026781abaa707582c63c.poster.avif?t=1790469106\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/234290f8a9f7026781abaa707582c63c.webm?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/234290f8a9f7026781abaa707582c63c.mp4?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your actions in turn-based battles, then land timed inputs to power up your attacks and guards. A good plan matters, but you still have to execute it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skills have limited uses, so your strongest move won\u2019t solve every problem. Spend it to finish an enemy now, protect a struggling teammate, or save it for whatever comes next. Every turn gives you something to think about.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">=== Upgrade everything ===</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/b485404388235d298a3766a792cebf93.poster.avif?t=1790469106\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/b485404388235d298a3766a792cebf93.webm?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/b485404388235d298a3766a792cebf93.mp4?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spend what you earn on a shared skill tree: new skills, spells and abilities for each hero, plus stat boosts for the whole party. Lost a fight? Upgrade, then go again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">=== Beat the bosses ===</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/d30a3a7039c223c6b1ceba536601a091.poster.avif?t=1790469106\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/d30a3a7039c223c6b1ceba536601a091.webm?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/d30a3a7039c223c6b1ceba536601a091.mp4?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eleven stages stand between you and the Goblin King, and his bosses don\u2019t go down quietly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">=== Enjoy the fireworks ===</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"336\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/3104e982982cdbcbe0c8162e70825a20.poster.avif?t=1790469106\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/3104e982982cdbcbe0c8162e70825a20.webm?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/extras/3104e982982cdbcbe0c8162e70825a20.mp4?t=1790469106\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start out barely qualified. By the end, every fight is a light show. Maybe you were never F-tier after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A turn-based RPG where three F-tier heroines set out to defeat the Goblin King. Time your attacks and blocks, make every skill count, and power up your party through a shared incremental skill tree. Built to be beaten in about 4 hours.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4883870/08f01c2363bd7c899623f1687b76a56a60f04208/header.jpg?t=1790469106", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Party-Based RPG", "Roguelike", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Turn-Based Tactics", "2D"], "developers": "Yukisora", "publishers": "Yukisora", "release_date": "Nov 30, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4883870", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/EbsPDNivsAs", "first_seen": 1790373600.0, "review_rank": 56}